Grammar

    0 $accept: if_data_block $end

    1 if_data_block: %empty
    2              | IF_DATA_BEGIN IF_DATA protocol block_data_list IF_DATA_END IF_DATA

    3 protocol: IDENT

    4 block_data_list: %empty
    5                | block_data_list block_data
    6                | block_data_list item_value

    7 block_data: IF_DATA_BEGIN block_name item_list IF_DATA_END block_name

    8 block_name: IDENT

    9 item_list: %empty
   10          | item_list block_data
   11          | item_list item_value

   12 item_value: IDENT
   13           | STRING
   14           | HEX
   15           | UINT
   16           | INT
   17           | FLOAT


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    IF_DATA_BEGIN (258) 2 7
    IF_DATA_END (259) 2 7
    UINT <uint64_t> (260) 15
    HEX <uint64_t> (261) 14
    INT <int64_t> (262) 16
    FLOAT <double> (263) 17
    IDENT <std::string> (264) 3 8 12
    IF_DATA (265) 2
    STRING <std::string> (266) 13


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (12)
        on left: 0
    if_data_block (13)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 0
    protocol <std::string> (14)
        on left: 3
        on right: 2
    block_data_list <std::vector<a2l::IfDataItem>> (15)
        on left: 4 5 6
        on right: 2 5 6
    block_data <a2l::IfDataItem> (16)
        on left: 7
        on right: 5 10
    block_name <std::string> (17)
        on left: 8
        on right: 7
    item_list <std::vector<a2l::IfDataItem>> (18)
        on left: 9 10 11
        on right: 7 10 11
    item_value <std::string> (19)
        on left: 12 13 14 15 16 17
        on right: 6 11


State 0

    0 $accept: . if_data_block $end

    IF_DATA_BEGIN  shift, and go to state 1

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (if_data_block)

    if_data_block  go to state 2


State 1

    2 if_data_block: IF_DATA_BEGIN . IF_DATA protocol block_data_list IF_DATA_END IF_DATA

    IF_DATA  shift, and go to state 3


State 2

    0 $accept: if_data_block . $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 4


State 3

    2 if_data_block: IF_DATA_BEGIN IF_DATA . protocol block_data_list IF_DATA_END IF_DATA

    IDENT  shift, and go to state 5

    protocol  go to state 6


State 4

    0 $accept: if_data_block $end .

    $default  accept


State 5

    3 protocol: IDENT .

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (protocol)


State 6

    2 if_data_block: IF_DATA_BEGIN IF_DATA protocol . block_data_list IF_DATA_END IF_DATA

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (block_data_list)

    block_data_list  go to state 7


State 7

    2 if_data_block: IF_DATA_BEGIN IF_DATA protocol block_data_list . IF_DATA_END IF_DATA
    5 block_data_list: block_data_list . block_data
    6                | block_data_list . item_value

    IF_DATA_BEGIN  shift, and go to state 8
    IF_DATA_END    shift, and go to state 9
    UINT           shift, and go to state 10
    HEX            shift, and go to state 11
    INT            shift, and go to state 12
    FLOAT          shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT          shift, and go to state 14
    STRING         shift, and go to state 15

    block_data  go to state 16
    item_value  go to state 17


State 8

    7 block_data: IF_DATA_BEGIN . block_name item_list IF_DATA_END block_name

    IDENT  shift, and go to state 18

    block_name  go to state 19


State 9

    2 if_data_block: IF_DATA_BEGIN IF_DATA protocol block_data_list IF_DATA_END . IF_DATA

    IF_DATA  shift, and go to state 20


State 10

   15 item_value: UINT .

    $default  reduce using rule 15 (item_value)


State 11

   14 item_value: HEX .

    $default  reduce using rule 14 (item_value)


State 12

   16 item_value: INT .

    $default  reduce using rule 16 (item_value)


State 13

   17 item_value: FLOAT .

    $default  reduce using rule 17 (item_value)


State 14

   12 item_value: IDENT .

    $default  reduce using rule 12 (item_value)


State 15

   13 item_value: STRING .

    $default  reduce using rule 13 (item_value)


State 16

    5 block_data_list: block_data_list block_data .

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (block_data_list)


State 17

    6 block_data_list: block_data_list item_value .

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (block_data_list)


State 18

    8 block_name: IDENT .

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (block_name)


State 19

    7 block_data: IF_DATA_BEGIN block_name . item_list IF_DATA_END block_name

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (item_list)

    item_list  go to state 21


State 20

    2 if_data_block: IF_DATA_BEGIN IF_DATA protocol block_data_list IF_DATA_END IF_DATA .

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (if_data_block)


State 21

    7 block_data: IF_DATA_BEGIN block_name item_list . IF_DATA_END block_name
   10 item_list: item_list . block_data
   11          | item_list . item_value

    IF_DATA_BEGIN  shift, and go to state 8
    IF_DATA_END    shift, and go to state 22
    UINT           shift, and go to state 10
    HEX            shift, and go to state 11
    INT            shift, and go to state 12
    FLOAT          shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT          shift, and go to state 14
    STRING         shift, and go to state 15

    block_data  go to state 23
    item_value  go to state 24


State 22

    7 block_data: IF_DATA_BEGIN block_name item_list IF_DATA_END . block_name

    IDENT  shift, and go to state 18

    block_name  go to state 25


State 23

   10 item_list: item_list block_data .

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (item_list)


State 24

   11 item_list: item_list item_value .

    $default  reduce using rule 11 (item_list)


State 25

    7 block_data: IF_DATA_BEGIN block_name item_list IF_DATA_END block_name .

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (block_data)
